          {
            "__component": "content.text",
            "id": 25,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Scaffolding Design",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Scaffolding design plays a crucial role in ensuring the safety, strength, and stability of any scaffold structure. A professional design takes into account key details such as site location, intended use, height, dimensions, maximum loads, ground conditions, and the type of building or structure being supported. This process ensures the scaffold performs safely and efficiently for both workers and the public.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A scaffolding design typically includes detailed drawings and structural calculations for a bespoke scaffold built to meet the specific needs of the project. In some cases, a full design may not be required if the scaffold follows a recognised “standard configuration” as outlined in the NASC TG20 guidelines.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "By using a properly designed scaffold, you can be confident that your project complies with all relevant safety standards, reduces risk on site, and provides a secure platform for construction, maintenance, or restoration work.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "highlight": false,
            "spacingTop": true,
            "spacingBottom": true
          }
        ]
