          {
            "__component": "content.split-content",
            "id": 4,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Scaffold Shrink Wrap",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Scaffold shrink wrap is a strong, high-quality polythene sheeting that is heat-sealed around scaffolding to form a tight, weatherproof barrier. This creates a secure enclosure that protects construction sites from wind, rain, and debris, helping work to continue safely and efficiently in all weather conditions.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Unlike traditional scaffold sheeting or tarpaulins, shrink wrap provides a smooth and drum-tight finish that will not flap or tear in high winds. It offers excellent durability, UV resistance, and long-term protection for both workers and materials on site.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Scaffold shrink wrap is an ideal solution for encapsulation, containment, and weather protection during construction, refurbishment, and painting projects. It is flame-retardant and often recyclable, making it a professional, environmentally responsible choice for temporary building protection across the UK.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "invert": false,
