          {
            "__component": "content.text",
            "id": 23,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "System Temporary Roof Scaffolding",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "System temporary roof scaffolding is a modern, modular solution designed to protect construction sites from rain, wind, and other environmental elements. Using prefabricated components, these systems are quick to assemble, adaptable to a wide range of structures, and highly effective for maintaining productivity in all weather conditions.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A system roof structure typically combines lightweight aluminium beams with a weather-resistant covering such as shrink wrap or corrugated sheeting. This creates a strong, watertight enclosure that allows work to continue safely and efficiently throughout roofing, restoration, or refurbishment projects.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "System temporary roofs are engineered for flexibility, making them suitable for projects of all sizes and complexities. They are ideal for sites where time, safety, and reliability are essential, offering a professional and cost-effective solution for long-term weather protection across the UK.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "highlight": false,
            "spacingTop": true,
            "spacingBottom": true
          }
        ]
