          {
            "__component": "content.text",
            "id": 24,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Traditional Temporary Roof Scaffolding",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Traditional temporary roof scaffolding is a proven method of providing weather protection on construction, refurbishment, and restoration projects. This system uses a robust framework of scaffold tubes and beams to support corrugated iron sheets, often referred to as “tin hats,” which create a secure and weatherproof covering over the structure.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "These systems are designed and erected around the building, forming a complete scaffold that is then overlaid with tightly fixed metal sheets. The result is a durable, water-resistant enclosure that shields workers, materials, and ongoing works from the elements, allowing construction to continue without delay.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Traditional temporary roofing remains one of the most effective and reliable ways to maintain productivity and site safety during periods of bad weather. It is particularly suited for projects requiring long-term protection and has been trusted across the UK for decades for its strength, stability, and dependability.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "highlight": false,
            "spacingTop": true,
            "spacingBottom": true
          }
